OL,3,GNEWSARevamp of Glasgow's Hielanman's
OL,4,AUmbrella landmark put on hold
OL,5,
OL,6,FA planned revamp of Glasgow's landmark
OL,7,F"Hielanman's Umbrella"  - a glass
OL,8,Ffronted railway bridge near Central
OL,9,FStation - has been put on hold.
OL,11,FArchitects Dress for the Weather were
OL,12,Fcommissioned in 2024 to create a fresh
OL,13,Fdesign for the site, which would have
OL,14,Fseen multi-coloured shops and neon
OL,15,Flights introduced.
OL,17,FThe area covers the bridge along with a
OL,18,Fsmall number of shops and venues
OL,19,Fbeneath it, including the former Arches
OL,20,Fnightclub.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
