OL,3,GNEWSARevamp of Glasgow's Hielanman's
OL,4,AUmbrella landmark put on hold
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the rail operator said the
OL,7,Fproject was now paused following a
OL,8,Freview, and Glasgow City Council said
OL,9,Fit was "reconsidering the future" for
OL,10,Fthe area as part of a wider review into
OL,11,FCentral Station.
